            <name>Commercial roof search leads</name>
            <Placemark id="70">
                <name>#1 Council Bluffs CSD – Bloomer Elementary (Council Bluffs, IA)</name>
                <description>Capital-plan signal (not yet bid) | capital plan (pre-bid) | Detected 2026-09-22 (district facility assessment)
District facility assessment lists Bloomer (Elementary) as a top project: ~$7.8M roof repair + HVAC VRF replacement package; described as a likely future bid once funding is aligned. Primary assessment document and timing are behind the aggregator's sign-up wall (not used). 2020 district Facility Master Plan also flagged Bloomer HVAC/controls.
Contact: Aaron Rang, Director of Facilities Maintenance &amp; Custodial Services (FMCS) · 712-328-6406 · arang@cb-schools.org
Confidence: unconfirmed (aggregator summary of assessment; no bid date yet)
Source: https://civiciq.com/public-project/bloomer-was-listed-as-a-top-project-with-a-78-million-roof-81a38563-d80d-4b39-87d9-99c5fce1c6bb ; https://www.cb-schools.org/departments/facilities
~4 mi from Omaha | preferred state: Yes</description>
                <styleUrl>#71</styleUrl>
                <Point id="69">
                    <coordinates>-95.8608,41.2619,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="75">
                <name>#2 Cuming County Courthouse (Cuming County, NE) (West Point, NE)</name>
                <description>Open public bid | seeking roofer | 2026-10-16 (published; re-runs 10/23)
Invitation to bid: removal and full roof replacement of the Cuming County Courthouse, 200 S. Lincoln St. Sealed bids due Tue Nov 10, 2026 10:30 AM (opened 10:45 AM); award Nov 24; completion desired by Apr 30, 2027. 5% bid bond/certified check; bidder must be membrane-manufacturer certified, 15+ yrs in business, proof of 1,000,000 sq low-slope membrane installed under warranty, no subcontracted labor. Documents at County Clerk, Room 100.
Contact: Brian Fischer, Grounds and Building Manager (project questions; mobile redacted on notice); County Clerk Addisen Johnson (bid documents) · (402) 372-6002 (County Clerk) · clerk@cumingcounty.ne.gov
Confidence: confirmed
Source: https://www.noticeregistry.com/nebraska/notice/bid-notice-west-point-768623
~57 mi from Omaha | preferred state: Yes</description>
                <styleUrl>#76</styleUrl>
                <Point id="74">
                    <coordinates>-96.7086,41.8417,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="80">
                <name>#3 SENCA – Tecumseh Senior Center building (Tecumseh, NE)</name>
                <description>Open public bid | seeking roofer | Published 2026-10-16; due Fri 2026-10-30 12:00 PM
Requests bids to repair or replace the roof at 172 S. 4th Street, Tecumseh; bids must closely match existing roofing material; due 12:00 p.m. Friday Oct 30. (Listing page opened; individual notice page link not retrievable — site blocks automated link capture.) Address is SENCA's Tecumseh Senior Center (per Nebraska Resource &amp; Referral System). Roof size/type not stated — likely small.
Contact: SENCA Tecumseh Senior Center (building phone) · (402) 335-2134
